<p><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">I swear to god if this gets downvoted I am just going to die</span></p>
<p>Well, here it is at long last. I went all out for this contest, with my most ambitious article to date, and I really hope people get <em>something</em> out of it, because I've been severely pessimistic about my ability to write skips for the last year or&#8230; five.</p>
<p>Many, many, many thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/anqxyr" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(966960); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=966960&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1491241916" alt="anqxyr" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=966960)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/anqxyr" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(966960); return false;">anqxyr</a></span> for writing the ListPages code for this, helping me figure out how to get my ideas to work on Wikidot, and a 0 hour hotfix. Thanks as well to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tuomey" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2161254); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2161254&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1491241916" alt="Tuomey" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2161254)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tuomey" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2161254); return false;">Tuomey</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aiden-eldritch" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2221240); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2221240&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1491241916" alt="Aiden Eldritch" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2221240)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aiden-eldritch" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2221240); return false;">Aiden Eldritch</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-random-day" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1841781); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1841781&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1491241916" alt="A Random Day" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1841781)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-random-day" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1841781); return false;">A Random Day</a></span> for further tech assist.</p>
<p>Feedback thanks goes to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/joreth" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1370009); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1370009&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1491241916" alt="Joreth" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1370009)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/joreth" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1370009); return false;">Joreth</a></span>, ARD and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1888434); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1888434&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1491241916" alt="djkaktus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1888434)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1888434); return false;">djkaktus</a></span>. I hope I've done their suggestions justice.</p>
<p>Further thanks involves spoilers, so do consider going back and refreshing a few times before you head to the collapsible.</p>
