<p>Original authors were contacted for permission when feasible. I have done my level best to rewrite the articles in my own words &#8212; no copy-pasting here, I promise! Some of these were more work than others. (Rewriting 173 to modern standards is the hardest thing I have ever done on this site.) Credit as follows:</p>
