<p>Articles were chosen from the highest-rated pages. I did my best to include articles from Series II and III, but oh boy, there aren't a lot of Series III on that list. (2521 was too hard to work with. :C) But there's at least one article from each Series in each subset of the first three tabs. And if you didn't notice, tab 4 is always 055, it's only the first three that change.</p>
<p>I hope I don't have to say it, but this isn't meant as a 'take that' to any of the featured articles, no matter how much I rewrote them. Any commentary is in-character for 3000, and 3000 is kind of a huge dick.</p>
<p>One more big thank-you to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sunnyclockwork" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1621343); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1621343&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1491241916" alt="SunnyClockwork" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1621343)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sunnyclockwork" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1621343); return false;">SunnyClockwork</a></span> for the image. I literally told her &quot;draw me something&quot;, and what a something she came up with! :D</p>
