			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2783008">
									

<p>Context should make the meaning clear. Mnesi- &quot;remembering&quot; is stemmed from mnasthai &quot;to remember&quot;; with the - tic suffix for medical agents it becomes mnestic. Which therefore is a drug that induces remembering. Adding the a- prefix would negate this and therefore amnestic would be a drug that induces forgetting. Since in the context the subjects are being expected to remember something, a drug that induces memory makes sense.</p>

